  "_comment": "ADR-037 register fragment, change voting-groups (board DcBeheer, Stemgroepen). A voting group is a fixed set of members of one body, such as the whole council, the presidium or the members of a committee, kept by the secretariat so the chair can pick it when a voting round opens.",
